Short:        Cross ref of 1.2 system assembler labels. V1.2
Author:       rhialto@mbfys.kun.nl (Olaf 'Rhialto' Seibert)
Version:      1.2
Requires:     .address
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Source:       Fish collection
Date:         1987.08.23

Alphabetic and numeric ordered cross reference lists
of defined system constants.  Recommended for debugging
purposes only, use the symbolic values in programs!
